[{"id":3007697088,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6zRdDA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR fails to compile when rebased on top of `master`:\r\n\r\n```\r\nCompiling modules/gridmap/editor/grid_map_editor_plugin.cpp ...\r\nCompiling editor/scene/3d/gizmos/.scu/scu_editor_scene_3d_gizmos.gen.cpp ...\r\nmodules/gridmap/editor/grid_map_editor_plugin.cpp: In member function 'bool GridMapEditor::do_input_action(Camera3D*, const Point2&, bool)':\r\nmodules/gridmap/editor/grid_map_editor_plugin.cpp:442:54: error: 'class LocalVector<GridMapEditor::SetItem>' has no member named 'back'\r\n  442 |                         Vector3i last_si = set_items.back()->get().position;\r\n      |                                                      ^~~~\r\nGenerating core/version_hash.gen.cpp ...\r\nscons: *** [bin/obj/modules/gridmap/editor/grid_map_editor_plugin.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.o] Error 1\r\nscons: building terminated because of errors.\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis is due to `set_items` now being a LocalVector since https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/workflow/pr_workflow.html#the-interactive-rebase was merged. LocalVector does not have a `back()` method (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99955), so you need to replace it with something else.\r\n\r\nSee [this page](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/contributing/workflow/pr_workflow.html#the-interactive-rebase) for instructions on rebasing the PR.","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105292#pullrequestreview-3007697088","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105292","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105292#pullrequestreview-3007697088"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105292"}},"submitted_at":"2025-07-10T23:08:59Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3064071013,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc62ogNl","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105292#pullrequestreview-3064071013","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105292","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105292#pullrequestreview-3064071013"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105292"}},"submitted_at":"2025-07-28T18:03:56Z","commit_id":null},{"id":3064103677,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc62ooL9","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally on all edit axes, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nTop is drawn without this PR, bottom is drawn with this PR (at a similar mouse speed for each). The editor is capped at 30 FPS for this demonstration, which will make the issue more noticeable (the lower the FPS, the more likely your cursor will be missing tiles).\r\n\r\n<img width=\"2834\" height=\"1631\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/da3a65f6-463c-421d-b313-63b6dbdacf55\" />\r\n\r\nNote that visible polygon edges will occur at low FPS, given your mouse cursor position is only sampled once per *rendered* frame. A more extensive solution could disable input accumulation when drawing in the GridMap editor, then using all the input positions recorded in a single frame to draw the tiles at the mouse's real position, which should lead to smoother curves. That said, this is not essential for an initial implementation, as it already helps a lot, especially when drawing straight (or mostly straight) lines.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105292#pullrequestreview-3064103677","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105292","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105292#pullrequestreview-3064103677"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105292"}},"submitted_at":"2025-07-28T18:14:20Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2762184884,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6ko5i0","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMME